      "cooked": "<p>It’s all about time</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-293-writers-room-time-trust-one-shot\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-293-writers-room-time-trust-one-shot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/ca864864fd4764e914bcab3670be2db68d1c0662.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-293-writers-room-time-trust-one-shot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Episode #293 - Writers' Room: Time Trust One-Shot</a></h3>\n\n  <p>It's about time!  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:26:49 We've told parts of this tale before, but never the whole thing at once, and some of it has never come up before! Also, we talk a bit about temporal positioning, including the when/where/whom of The...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/91c60e831c25d44d3182f45ffecbb0a087fe9184.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/91c60e831c25d44d3182f45ffecbb0a087fe9184\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/91c60e831c25d44d3182f45ffecbb0a087fe9184_2_329x499.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"kNzzchJSz0qR0V9pxTY7lfTNQ7W\" width=\"329\" height=\"499\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/91c60e831c25d44d3182f45ffecbb0a087fe9184_2_329x499.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/91c60e831c25d44d3182f45ffecbb0a087fe9184_2_493x748.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/91c60e831c25d44d3182f45ffecbb0a087fe9184_2_658x998.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/91c60e831c25d44d3182f45ffecbb0a087fe9184_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×2911 522 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
