      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2024-09-10T16:18:30.027Z",
      "cooked": "<p>WTF is this cover? c_c That’s a real choice with the style…</p>\n<p>It’s absolutely been a weird year.</p>\n<p>I dearly love Adam’s description of this as being “an athleticism”. XD</p>\n<p>Oh god, I’ve had “Higher” stuck in my head for days for no good reason and I only just got it out, guys!</p>\n<p>“…and then you put away the Chrono-Ranger deck and get a new deck.” More things need to be described this way lmao</p>\n<p>I’m here for Aata and Arataki being the best Hakas. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"> Canon.</p>\n<p>They’re right that you could skip this issue, it’s mostly just moving pieces around. But I like how intensely interesting each of those pieces is. This issue totally justifies itself when it might otherwise be a hard sell.</p>\n<p>Gremlins being intentionall inconsistent is cool. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>It just goes to show short letters do not necessarily beget shorter or less valuable answers!</p>\n<p>Writer’s Room: The Prime Wardens vs. the Elbow Monster, send tweet</p>\n<p>Guise once again getting picked last for superhero kickball.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2024-09-10T16:18:30.027Z",
