      "raw": "WTF is this cover? c_c That's a real choice with the style...\n\nIt's absolutely been a weird year.\n\nI dearly love Adam's description of this as being \"an athleticism\". XD\n\nOh god, I've had \"Higher\" stuck in my head for days for no good reason and I only just got it out, guys!\n\n\"...and then you put away the Chrono-Ranger deck and get a new deck.\" More things need to be described this way lmao\n\nI'm here for Aata and Arataki being the best Hakas. :) Canon.\n\nThey're right that you could skip this issue, it's mostly just moving pieces around. But I like how intensely interesting each of those pieces is. This issue totally justifies itself when it might otherwise be a hard sell.\n\nGremlins being intentionall inconsistent is cool. :D\n\nIt just goes to show short letters do not necessarily beget shorter or less valuable answers!\n\nWriter's Room: The Prime Wardens vs. the Elbow Monster, send tweet\n\nGuise once again getting picked last for superhero kickball.",
